# Go backend

- Layers: `domain` (no fiber/pgx imports) → `application` → `infrastructure` / `delivery` / `platform`.
- SQL only in `infrastructure/persistence/postgres`.
- Run/tests from `backend/`: `go test ./...`, `go run ./cmd/server`.
